## Round 2: the task SHAs at the end of each task line

Role: measure-jr-green. role_base_sha = 74700c2. HEAD at start: 74700c2
(clean tree). Plan commit: 815afa2.

The guard rule reads a task SHA with `(?:^|\s)`?([0-9a-f]{7})`?\s*$`, so it
only reads a SHA at the end of the task line. Task 1.1 and Task 1.2 carried
their SHA in the middle of the line, and the guard reported both lines as
